<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure S1</span>: </span><span id="A1.F1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Clock annotation density heatmap.<span id="A1.F1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Distribution of labeled times across all hours (1–12) and minutes (0–59). Color intensity represents <math id="A1.F1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ln(1+\text{count})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>count</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln(1+\text{count})</annotation></semantics></math> to balance visibility across frequency ranges. Darker regions indicate higher sample density, with notable concentration around 10:10.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
